export anchor IsometricStyle:
    number: 66
    screen: Onboarding
    name: Isometric
    idea: Progress is built as a staircase of isometric blocks drawn at 30 degrees, and every card, row and button is a flat shaded slab with a visible bottom face.
    base: light
    palette:
        ground: #eef2f8, the page, with faint indigo grid lines at 30 and 150 degrees
        top: #ffffff, top faces, the main slab and fields
        side: #dfe6f1, left faces and row bottom faces
        edge: #c3cee0, right faces and the slab bottom face
        indigoTop: #8f9bff, the current platform top and the typed row edge
        indigo: #4f5fe0, the Continue button, links and the focus outline
        indigoDeep: #3a48b8, button bottom faces and the Building word
        tealTop: #3fd0ac, the finished platform top
        teal: #147a61, the Built and Added words
        amber: #f2a93b, teammate figures and the brand cube
        ink: #1d2433, headings and body
        muted: #556074, labels, the line and dashed outlines
        rose: #b8325f, the Typing word
    type:
        Avenir Next, Avenir, Century Gothic, Futura, Segoe UI, system-ui. The
        heading is 40px bold with minus 2.5 percent tracking. The lead line
        is 17px in muted, body is 15px at 1.55 with emails at weight 600,
        step names are 14px bold, and labels are 11 to 12px bold caps with
        12 to 18 percent tracking.
    layout:
        A plain top line with an amber cube logo and Mara Okafor beside a
        teal cube. Below, a two column stage. The left column has a small
        caps eyebrow, then an SVG illustration of four isometric platforms
        on a grey base rising from front left to back right. The first is
        teal with a red flag, the second is indigo with three small block
        people, and the last two are white with dashed tops. Under it the
        four steps sit in a four column row with a coloured left rule. The
        right column is one white slab with the heading, line, invite rows,
        the seat note, Copy invite link, then Back, Skip for now and
        Continue. Below 960px the columns stack, and below 560px the steps
        become a two by two grid.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 40px slab padding, 12px between rows, 48px between illustration and slab.
    density: Airy. Half the screen is illustration and the form holds only what the step needs.
    corners: Nearly square at 3 to 4px. Isometric faces are true parallelograms.
    borders: None on surfaces. Only planned things get a dashed 1.5px muted outline. The typed row has a 2px indigo inset ring.
    shadows:
        A solid bottom face instead of blur, 10px of #c3cee0 under the slab,
        5px under buttons and 4px under rows. The slab also has a soft 40px
        drop below. Buttons press down by 5px when active.
    icons:
        Built on a hexagon, the outline of a cube seen from its corner. An
        outlined hexagon with a tick means done or added, a filled hexagon
        with a play mark means building, and a dashed hexagon means planned.
        Avatars are three tone cubes, and seats are three solid indigo cubes
        and two dashed wireframe cubes. Line icons are 18px with a 1.8 stroke.
    focus: A 3px solid indigo outline offset 3px. A focused field gets a white fill, an indigo underline and a 2px indigo inset ring.
    tone: Calm builder words, such as Built, Building and Planned.
